      "Passivity and helplessness",
      "Unethical behavior",
      "Self-centered thinking",
      "Giving up easily",
      "Blaming others",
      "Negative relationships",
      "Avoidance of responsibility",
      "Pessimistic outlook",
      "Destructive behavior",
      "Lack of empathy",
      "Short-term thinking",
      "Escapist tendencies",
      "Victim mentality",
      "Cynical worldview"
